{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：经at.exe横向移动。对应需求：横向移动。官方：At.exe Command Lateral Movement。","from":"now-119m","index":["endgame-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.*","winlogbeat-*"],"interval":"60m","language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：经at.exe横向移动","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"b483365c-98a8-40c0-92d8-0458ca25058a","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 横向移动","来源: 默认","对应需求: 横向移动"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and process.name : \"at.exe\" and process.args : \"\\\\\\\\*\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1021","name":"Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1053","name":"Scheduled Task/Job","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1053.002","name":"At","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/002/"},{"id":"T1053.005","name":"Scheduled Task","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/005/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"}],"note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：经at.exe横向移动\n\n### 为何重要\n向其他主机扩散\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","cloud